    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Diver</strong> is a roguelite shooting game in which a rubber duck dives into the world of nightmares to defeat enemies and rescue a young girl from her bad dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Duck\u2019s Mission </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a small rubber duck from the bathtub. Your owner, a little girl, is tormented by nightmares every night due to her worries. Determined to save her, the brave rubber duck dives into the bathtub, which leads to the world of dreams. Will you be able to discover the root of the girl\u2019s troubles hidden deep within the nightmare and successfully free her from her worries?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/e735e9c690f375c67076b8419ba57e9b.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/e735e9c690f375c67076b8419ba57e9b.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/e735e9c690f375c67076b8419ba57e9b.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battling with Bubbles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Your weapon is your bubble shot. Capture the enemies in your bubbles and defeat them by making the bubbles explode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/51344ee027b572225c618a49b90488d9.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/51344ee027b572225c618a49b90488d9.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/51344ee027b572225c618a49b90488d9.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duck Power-Ups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you clear a stage, your duck gradually grows stronger. Your fighting style might change depending on your power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/afed67d36f95057feb0ad27436932419.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/afed67d36f95057feb0ad27436932419.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/afed67d36f95057feb0ad27436932419.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bubble Combos and Combo Builds </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together bubble explosions to create combos and make items drop. You can customize these items to your advantage in battle. Use bubble combos and combo builds to advance through each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/1ada202fdbcdfbb67e9a0dae9bc5c95b.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/1ada202fdbcdfbb67e9a0dae9bc5c95b.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/1ada202fdbcdfbb67e9a0dae9bc5c95b.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Rescue Your Friends! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry-they\u2019re not dirty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your toy friends who are trapped in the nightmare. These friends may make your duck stronger or have fun conversations with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with helping your friends, you can collect the girl\u2019s belongings to discover more about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/96e1b61121a278a36aee87470f23c1fc.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/96e1b61121a278a36aee87470f23c1fc.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/96e1b61121a278a36aee87470f23c1fc.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Diver</strong> is a roguelite shooting game in which a rubber duck dives into the world of nightmares to defeat enemies and rescue a young girl from her bad dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > The Duck\u2019s Mission </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a small rubber duck from the bathtub. Your owner, a little girl, is tormented by nightmares every night due to her worries. Determined to save her, the brave rubber duck dives into the bathtub, which leads to the world of dreams. Will you be able to discover the root of the girl\u2019s troubles hidden deep within the nightmare and successfully free her from her worries?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/e735e9c690f375c67076b8419ba57e9b.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/e735e9c690f375c67076b8419ba57e9b.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/e735e9c690f375c67076b8419ba57e9b.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battling with Bubbles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Your weapon is your bubble shot. Capture the enemies in your bubbles and defeat them by making the bubbles explode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/51344ee027b572225c618a49b90488d9.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/51344ee027b572225c618a49b90488d9.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/51344ee027b572225c618a49b90488d9.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duck Power-Ups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you clear a stage, your duck gradually grows stronger. Your fighting style might change depending on your power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/afed67d36f95057feb0ad27436932419.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/afed67d36f95057feb0ad27436932419.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/afed67d36f95057feb0ad27436932419.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bubble Combos and Combo Builds </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together bubble explosions to create combos and make items drop. You can customize these items to your advantage in battle. Use bubble combos and combo builds to advance through each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/1ada202fdbcdfbb67e9a0dae9bc5c95b.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/1ada202fdbcdfbb67e9a0dae9bc5c95b.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/1ada202fdbcdfbb67e9a0dae9bc5c95b.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Rescue Your Friends! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry-they\u2019re not dirty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your toy friends who are trapped in the nightmare. These friends may make your duck stronger or have fun conversations with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with helping your friends, you can collect the girl\u2019s belongings to discover more about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/96e1b61121a278a36aee87470f23c1fc.poster.avif?t=1747004941\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/96e1b61121a278a36aee87470f23c1fc.webm?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709870/extras/96e1b61121a278a36aee87470f23c1fc.mp4?t=1747004941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
